# Binary handling only. Line endings are deliberately NOT normalized here.
#
# This repository is checked out with CRLF in some Go files and LF in the rest,
# as committed. Forcing eol=lf would rewrite every one of those files on the
# next checkout, so a one-line logic change would show up as a whole-file diff
# and `gofmt -l` would flag files that were already correctly formatted. Mixed
# endings are pre-existing; this file's job is only to stop git from corrupting
# genuine binaries.

# Windows-specific artefacts are genuinely binary.
*.exe binary
*.cab binary
*.msi binary
*.wim binary

# Generated or vendored, never diffed.
vendor/ binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
